# Nested companion project (its own git repo, moved in under the sentinel family)


# The built-in agent packages (chat, osint, osint_heavy, wifi, manager, sentry)
# live in-tree, like vpn_agent: a fresh clone must import main.py and collect
# the test suite without a side channel. Their former nested .git directories
# are archived under _archive/ (ignored) rather than deleted.
/_archive/
/agents/*/.pytest_cache/
/agents/*/.ruff_cache/
/agents/*/data/
